text Naranja_MandarinIslandSouth_ContestLobby_Text_08177D6C {
    "I went in through the entrance and\ntook a look around the CONTEST hall.\pGetting up on that big stage...\nIt’s going to be tense!"
}

text Naranja_MandarinIslandSouth_ContestLobby_Text_08177DEC {
    "Oh, my love for POKéMON...\nThe attraction they evoke in me...\pWhoops!\nYou weren’t meant to see that!\lWell, anyway.\pIf you’re entering a CONTEST, try this\nmove on for size."
}

text Naranja_MandarinIslandSouth_ContestLobby_Text_08177E98 {
    "My feelings for POKéMON...\nOh, they attract me so..."
}

text Naranja_MandarinIslandSouth_ContestLobby_Text_08177ECD {
    "Which CONTEST are you planning on\nentering?\pIf you’re entering a COOL CONTEST,\na cool POKéMON has to be the one!\pPick a POKéMON worthy of the CONTEST\ntheme, and make sure it has the\lright set of moves to match.\pThat’s fundamental!"
}
